          deckDescription: 'Cöch is traditionally played with the special Cucco deck (Figure I-X and Matte; 40 cards, Masenghini). For standard implementation a 40-card stripped French deck is used: four suits, eight ranks per suit (6 through Ace), 40 cards total.',
